A minimal govulncheck DB reporting one called vulnerability in each of the
four x/ modules the fixture exercises:

  GO-2023-2402  golang.org/x/crypto/ssh.NewClientConn        fixed 0.17.0
  GO-2023-1572  golang.org/x/image/tiff.Decode              fixed 0.5.0
  GO-2023-1988  golang.org/x/net/html.Render                fixed 0.13.0
  GO-2022-1059  golang.org/x/text/language.ParseAcceptLanguage fixed 0.14.0

Each vuln is CALLED, so the blast radius is a clean four-module bump. The
fixed versions are the lowest real releases that fix each vuln AND resolve
together in a single `go get`: x/text's true fix is 0.3.8, but x/crypto
v0.17.0 requires x/text v0.14.0, so it is raised to 0.14.0 for consistency.
